#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Moving and Copying Data"
msgstr "Flytta och kopiera data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"Data which have been entered once into a spreadsheet can be moved to new "
"locations and possibly duplicated. The simplest way to do this involves "
"dragging the selection box. A more advanced way involves a formal cut or "
"copy operation and then a paste operation in the new location. The latter "
"approach allows the data to be modified as they are pasted which can be "
"extremely important."
msgstr ""
"Data som redan har matats in i ett kalkylblad kan flyttas till nya platser "
"eller kopieras. Enklast gör du det genom att dra markeringen. En mer "
"avancerad metod är att klippa ut eller kopiera data och sedan klistra in dem"
" på den nya platsen. Då kan du även ändra data medan du klistrar in dem, "
"vilket ibland är viktigt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:14 C/gnumeric.xml:141
msgid "NOTE"
msgstr "OBS!"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:15
msgid ""
"Currently <application>Gnumeric</application> only supports copying, cutting"
" and pasting of simple selections or continuous selections as described in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>. You cannot copy, cut or paste "
"discontinuous selections."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande går det bara att kopiera, klippa ut och klistra in enskilda "
"eller sammanhängande markeringar i <application>Gnumeric</application>, "
"enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>. Det går "
"inte att kopiera, klippa ut eller klistra in icke-sammanhängande "
"markeringar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid ""
"It is frequently necessary to copy the results of complex calculations into "
"a new location. This is done by selecting the data and using the "
"<guimenuitem>As Value</guimenuitem> command from the <guimenuitem>Paste "
"Special...</guimenuitem> dialog. This is explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"movecopy-pastespecial\"/> below."
msgstr ""
"Ofta behöver du kopiera resultatet av komplicerade beräkningar till en annan"
" plats. Markera data och välj <guimenuitem>Som värde</guimenuitem> i "
"dialogrutan <guimenuitem>Klistra in special…</guimenuitem>. Detta beskrivs "
"nedan i <xref linkend=\"sect-movecopy-pastespecial\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:35
msgid "Simple Copy and Move"
msgstr "Enkel kopiering och flytt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:37
msgid ""
"The easiest way to move or copy a cell or a group of cells is by selecting "
"the cell or cells to be moved or copied, then using the mouse to drag the "
"selection box to a new location."
msgstr ""
"Enklast flyttar eller kopierar du en cell eller ett cellområde genom att "
"markera det och dra markeringen till den nya platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:45
msgid ""
"Select a cell to move by clicking in it. You can also select a range of "
"cells as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på cellen som ska flyttas. Du kan också markera ett cellområde enligt"
" beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-selections\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:52
msgid ""
"Click <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button on the border of the "
"selection (anywhere except the autofill square in the bottom right corner). "
"Use <mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button to move cells or "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap>+<mousebutton>left</mousebutton> mouse button to copy "
"cells."
msgstr ""
"Klicka med <mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp på markeringens kant,"
" men inte på den lilla rutan för automatisk ifyllning längst ned till höger."
" Dra med <mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp för att flytta "
"cellerna. Håll ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> och klicka med "
"<mousebutton>vänster</mousebutton> musknapp för att kopiera dem."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:62
msgid "Drag the selection to the new location."
msgstr "Dra markeringen till den nya platsen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:66
msgid "Release the mouse button."
msgstr "Släpp musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:70
msgid ""
"The selected cells will be copied or moved to the new location. This will "
"move both cells' content and formatting. When copying, relative cell "
"references in all formulas will change as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"data-formulas-references\"/>; when moving, relative cell references will "
"remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"De markerade cellerna kopieras eller flyttas till den nya platsen, "
"tillsammans med innehåll och formatering. När du kopierar ändras relativa "
"cellreferenser i formler, enligt beskrivningen i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"formulas-references\"/>. När du flyttar celler förblir de relativa "
"cellreferenserna oförändrade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:82
msgid "Cut, Copy and Paste"
msgstr "Klipp ut, kopiera och klistra in"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:84
msgid ""
"Another, more flexible, way to copy or move a selection is to use cut, copy,"
" and paste operations. These operations allow the user to copy or move "
"selected cells to the clipboard buffer and then paste the contents of the "
"clipboard buffer to a different location or a different workbook."
msgstr ""
"Ett mer flexibelt sätt att kopiera eller flytta en markering är att använda "
"kommandona Klipp ut, Kopiera och Klistra in. Med dem kan du kopiera eller "
"flytta markerade celler till urklippet och sedan klistra in innehållet på en"
" annan plats eller i en annan arbetsbok."
